description	"Mandalorian Neo-Crusader Rally-Master

Battle proven Mandalorians who is entrusted with specialized weaponry, armor and potential command over warriors.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Mandalorian Vibrosword
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- Single Saber (Purple/Red Style)
-- Dual Saber (Duals Style)
-- Vibrostaff (Staff)
-- Saber Defense (1)
- Mandalorian Heavy Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- 10% More Damage, 15% Slower RoF

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (2)
- Strength (1)
- Stat Viewer
- Physical Resist
- 20% less Kb Taken
- Environment Protection (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (1)
- 25% slower Skill CD
- Anti Mind Trick (1)

^8Abilities:
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS3]"
